Subject: Preserve the annotation JSON marshaler contract

Management-common's shared ygot runtime must retain the original RFC7952
annotation API while using SONiC's optimized JSON renderer. The optimized
path bypasses Annotation.MarshalJSON. Route annotation fields through the
existing annotation helper so custom output and marshaler errors remain
observable; ordinary fields keep the optimized tag-path cache.

Origin: SONiC shared-module compatibility correction exposed by the
original annotation-rendering tests; not an upstream backport claim.
https://github.com/securely1g/sonic-bazel-registry/pull/214

diff --git a/ygot/render.go b/ygot/render.go
--- a/ygot/render.go
+++ b/ygot/render.go
@@ -986,7 +986,11 @@
 		}
 
 		var value interface{}
-		value, err = jsonValue(field, pmod, args, tagPaths)
+		if util.IsYgotAnnotation(fType) {
+			value, err = jsonAnnotationSlice(field)
+		} else {
+			value, err = jsonValue(field, pmod, args, tagPaths)
+		}
 
 		if err != nil {
 			errs.Add(err)
